| **“Slipped” to 132** | **“Upgraded” to 132** | Direction word decides the stem |
| **PQLI (Morris)** | **HDI (UNDP / Haq)** | Older physical-quality index vs UNDP HDI |
| **GHI edition year** | **Latest GHI you remember** | Stem year wins |
